      "value": "I would mark this as complete for the basics, as in need some more improvements.\nFollow up posts:\n[1222] Profiles for Earmuffs & Hide Avatar by Distance, or dynamic.\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/open-beta/p/1222-profiles-for-earmuffs-hide-avatar-by-distance-or-dynamic\n[1222] Hide Avatar by Distance slows other things down when it shouldn’t.\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/open-beta/p/1222-hide-avatar-by-distance-slows-other-things-down-when-it-shouldnt",
